      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start, definitely hits the main points. \n\nhonestly though, it's a bit short. looking at the script, the word count is pretty low—around 160 words. i know i said not to use fluff, but i really need a much more \"comprehensive\" deep dive for the dev team to actually use this. they need to see every little detail from the feedback to spot trends.\n\ncan you expand this into a much more thorough, exhaustive report? try to go much deeper into every single aspect mentioned in the reviews. i'm looking for a lot more substance and detail here so the word count reflects a truly comprehensive analysis. just please make sure it stays relevant to the reviews!",
